error: Invalid version passed (asdfasdf)

Pass a semver, or a full 40 character git commit hash, or a release channel name.

Usage:
Latest
  ende upgrade

Specific version
  ende upgrade 1.45.0
  ende upgrade 1.46.0-rc.1
  ende upgrade 9bc2dd29ad6ba334fd57a20114e367d3c04763d4

Channel
  ende upgrade stable
  ende upgrade alpha
  ende upgrade beta
  ende upgrade rc
  ende upgrade canary

From a pull request (requires gh CLI)
  ende upgrade pr 12345
